  "artifacts": "dist/rdp-hybrid/receive-feedback-exp63",
  "implemented": [
    "Negotiated optional qsm_video_received feedback over the existing unordered cursor channel; exact op/RTP schema and independent bounded server history",
    "A ready-checked receiver RTCRtpScriptTransform forwards the original encoded frame unchanged and reports its RTP timestamp before decoder playout; at most one worker report is outstanding",
    "Receipt feedback uses a recent 180 ms delivery window, minimum 100 ms; legacy presentation feedback retains its longer noise-tolerant window",
    "Server clears rate/baseline/credit windows when switching between receipt and display feedback; presentation feedback resumes after receipt expiry",
    "Existing UI/video synchronization acknowledgements remain independent",
    "Qt QPlainTextEdit/QTextEdit geometry uses public viewport-relative cursor bounds including style/frame offsets",
    "Generic Qt plugin instances have Qt as sole owner; aboutToQuit stops publishing and unregisters its service; package builds test full application destruction for Qt5/Qt6"
  ],
